# Deploy only the generated read-only website. Research caches and processed
# intelligence remain local and are never part of the Vercel upload bundle.
#
# Use explicit exclusions instead of a catch-all plus negations. Vercel's
# upload walker can prune an ignored parent before evaluating its children,
# which previously produced a successful but empty (404) deployment.
/.git/
/.gitignore
/.pytest_cache/
/.vercel/
/README.md
/artifacts/
/clubalpha/
/config/
/data/
/docs/
/reports/
/research/
/scripts/
/tests/
/web/scripts/
